# gwm-reader publishes only. It has no read rule, so it cannot subscribe to
# anything, including the Home Assistant topics. Discovery is retained.
user gwm_reader
topic write gwmbrasil/#
topic write homeassistant/+/gwmbrasil/#

# Home Assistant reads only.
user homeassistant
topic read gwmbrasil/#
topic read homeassistant/#

# Kinestra (or any downstream bridge) reads only the raw snapshots.
user kinestra_bridge
topic read gwmbrasil/+/snapshot
